{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959530/extras/10e9d058f301d745b93d2fb710dbe66c.avif?t=1769160504\" width=1280 height=438 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Landscape Simulator</strong> is a relaxing, hands-on sim where you transform messy outdoor spaces into lush, inviting landscapes. Equip your trusty weed whacker, power up the pressure washer, and roll out your trash vacuum to tidy up homes, parks, gardens, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From overgrown grass, stubborn weeds, dirt-covered fences, and littered walkways, each environment offers a new challenge and a chance to make the world a little cleaner, one satisfying task at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you answer the call to cleanse and restore?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cut Grass</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use precise tools to trim grass and remove stubborn weeds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959530/extras/70c4c01ce0ec9fc17b85ac3215a79d2e.poster.avif?t=1769160504\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959530/extras/70c4c01ce0ec9fc17b85ac3215a79d2e.webm?t=1769160504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pressure Wash</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Blast dirt from fences, houses, benches, and public structures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959530/extras/218fa1bc8bc80195e38fbfbaf7b15d61.poster.avif?t=1769160504\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959530/extras/218fa1bc8bc80195e38fbfbaf7b15d61.webm?t=1769160504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959530/extras/218fa1bc8bc80195e38fbfbaf7b15d61.mp4?t=1769160504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Vacuum Trash</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Suck up garbage from streets, parks, and hidden corners.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959530/extras/1f3a7309ca0aaba08ad456c7812d031a.poster.avif?t=1769160504\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959530/extras/1f3a7309ca0aaba08ad456c7812d031a.webm?t=1769160504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959530/extras/1f3a7309ca0aaba08ad456c7812d031a.mp4?t=1769160504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cozy Cleanup Missions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Relaxing objectives across diverse levels like:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suburban homes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >City parks and graveyards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rooftop gardens</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outdoor cinemas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Museum entrances</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Visually Satisfying</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Watch neglected spaces transform as you work.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Soothing Atmosphere</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Peaceful vibes, gentle soundscapes, and stress-free progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're here for the satisfying gameplay loop or just want to unwind with a peaceful chore, Landscape Simulator offers a cozy, feel-good experience for players of all skill levels.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3959530?t=1769160504","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3959530?t=1769160504","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959530/2f8445987818b1c088d346e99259b08116887d72/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769160504","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959530/2f8445987818b1c088d346e99259b08116887d72/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769160504","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959530/extras/10e9d058f301d745b93d2fb710dbe66c.avif?t=1769160504\" width=1280 height=438 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Landscape Simulator</strong> is a relaxing, hands-on sim where you transform messy outdoor spaces into lush, inviting landscapes. Equip your trusty weed whacker, power up the pressure washer, and roll out your trash vacuum to tidy up homes, parks, gardens, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From overgrown grass, stubborn weeds, dirt-covered fences, and littered walkways, each environment offers a new challenge and a chance to make the world a little cleaner, one satisfying task at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you answer the call to cleanse and restore?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cut 